# Token budget

- Prefer short answers. Skip recaps unless asked.
- Read/search only what the task needs. No broad audits.
- Don’t dump large code blocks or full-file rewrites when a small diff works.
- Don’t launch extra subagents or long shell dumps for simple asks.
- One clarifying question max if blocked; otherwise pick a sane default.
